      <h3>Long-term partnerships</h3>
      <p>My favorite way to work together. An ongoing partnership lets my audience watch your destination or product become part of our real life across a season, building the trust that moves a mom from interested to booked. Ambassadorships and recurring content series give us room to learn what resonates and build on it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mk-partner">
      <p class="step">02 / Bring your brief to life</p>
      <h3>Custom campaigns</h3>
      <p>Have a campaign or season to promote? I bring it to life with storytelling built for solo moms: sponsored and collaborative reels, story coverage, blog features on shedarestogo.com, and the photo and B-roll assets your team can keep using after the post is live. Every campaign starts with testing: multiple hooks and first frames run as trials with new audiences, and the proven winner is what runs as your main post. Deliverables are shaped to your goals and your budget conversation starts with a call, not a form.</p>
    </div>

